{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34708","headline":"彼农二章 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"彼农二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世路浇险，淳风荡除。\n彼农家流，犹存厥初。\n藁焉而席，茨焉而居。\n首乱如葆，形枯若腒。\n大耋既鲐，童子未𪘯\n以负以载，悉薅悉鉏。\n我慕圣道，我躭古书。\n小倦於学，时游汝庐。\n有饭一盛，莫盐莫蔬。\n有繻一缇，不襟不袪。\n所谓饥寒，汝何逭欤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}